## 2. Port layout (cite, do not invent)

Packed buses (Yosys SV frontend):

| Port | Width | Layout |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `solid_bits` | `MAX_E` | bit `e` = edge e solid |
| `syn_mem` / `bnd_mem` | `8*MAX_N` | byte `i` at `[i*8 +: 8]`; peel uses bit 0 (unchanged) |
| `eu_mem` / `ev_mem` | `IDX_W*MAX_E` | word `e` at `[e*IDX_W +: IDX_W]` |
| `corr_bits` | `MAX_E` | packed output |

TB-only pack helper: `aether_uf_tb_pack_peel_in` (unpacked arrays → buses; **not** synthesized).

`obs_egress.corr_bits` → packed to match peel (H10 obs TB).

